# SEO, Accessibility, Performance

Generated sites must be guest-ready (per promo footer bar).

- **Unique metadata** per page — title, description, Open Graph from `SiteContent.meta`.
- **Structured data** — `LodgingBusiness` / `Hotel` JSON-LD on home; `Room` on room pages (Phase 2 publish).
- **Semantic HTML** — landmarks, heading hierarchy, meaningful `alt` on all images.
- **Performance** — Next.js Image with responsive sizes; lazy-load below-fold gallery images.
- **Mobile responsive** — primary browse context for guests.
- **Sitemap + robots.txt** — generated per published site (Phase 2).

Phase 1 preview should still render correct heading structure and alt text using questionnaire/LLM output.
